// Clue - EpisodeFourteenClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P4205585166" "It all started when Harvey Maylor came to you for help. One of his reporters, Ellie Weissman, had been kidnapped by the Carnival. You went to her office and found the Carnival trying to dispose of her notes. You were only able to save one thing: an appointment calendar that listed a meeting with Percy Winkley of the Midnight Squad. <br><br>After obtaining the location of his secret library from Maria Jenkins, you paid Mr. Winkley a visit. You arrived just in time to rescue him from some Carnival goons. He told you that he had spoken to Ellie about some bracelets called the Bands of Shu. He also gave you a mental monocle that would allow you to pluck Ellie's current whereabouts from the minds of the carnies. <br><br>You took to the streets and returned with knowledge of Ellie's location. <br><br>She was being held in an old warehouse. You ventured there, and managed to free her from the Carnival. She told you about her investigation into the Bands' power. She seemed to believe they could help you fight the Carnival. <br><br>To recover the Bands, you had to go up against the Malta Group, who were keeping the bracelets locked away in one of their bases. <br><br>Then you had to empower them. You brought the Bands into contact with some Devouring Earth creatures to anchor them in this reality. Then you faced the Praetorians while wearing them, in order to give the Bands a taste of that which lies beyond this world. Lastly, you brought them to Penelope Yin to complete the ritual. <br><br>With the Bands empowered, you were ready to set foot on the psychic plane for the first time. You journeyed there and uncovered three of Vanessa's memories: some travel guides to Italy, a porcelain mask, and a pile of bones belonging to a woman named Giovanna Scaldi. <br><br>Giovanna Scaldi had to be important, but you didn't know how. You went back to the psychic plane, but this time you were unable to learn anything. Vanessa had found a way to protect her memories. <br><br>Harvey suggested you turn to Penelope Yin for help. You brought the mental monocle to her, and she was able to greatly amplify its power. <br><br>The next time you went to the psychic plane, you were able to use the monocle to summon forth a memory of Vanessa in her younger days. She told you about her first trip to Venice, where she found a lovely porcelain mask. <br><br>It was enough to pique your curiosity, and you went back to learn more. The next time you encountered a memory of Vanessa, she told you about the first and only time she put on the mask. When she put it on, the mind of Giovanna Scaldi flooded into hers. It seemed that Giovanna was an old Venetian criminal who had preserved her life by putting her soul into the mask. Terrified, Vanessa packed away the mask and vowed never to wear it again. <br><br>You and Harvey agreed: you had to know more. You went back to the psychic plane, where you encountered one last reflection of Vanessa. She told you that She had put on the mask in order to use its powers to battle the Rikti. She succeeded, but she was never again separate from Giovanna. <br><br>Harvey had a bold idea. If you could defeat Giovanna upon the psychic plane, Vanessa might be freed. You went again to Penelope Yin, who modified the monocle once more. Now you could use it to draw forth the soul of Giovanna. You did so, and defeated the mighty villain on the psychic plane. <br><br>You were hopeful that Vanessa and her minions had now been freed from Giovanna's psychic grip. You went to one of their hideouts, but learned that your hopes had been in vain. The Carnival was still going strong, with Vanessa holding the reigns. Apparently she had learned much from her time with Giovanna."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL9_Carnival_SA 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P1764544002" "Vanessa DeVore's mask"
// tDetailString :
"P3516395918" "Although you defeated the soul of Giovanna Scaldi on the psychic plane, you can still feel a weakened, resentful presence stirring within this porcelain mask. You've kept it as a reminder of the time you spent doing battle: <br><br>Upon the Psychic Plane <br><br>It all started when Harvey Maylor came to you for help. One of his reporters, Ellie Weissman, had been kidnapped by the Carnival. You went to her office and found the Carnival trying to dispose of her notes. You were only able to save one thing: an appointment calendar that listed a meeting with Percy Winkley of the Midnight Squad. <br><br>After obtaining the location of his secret library from Maria Jenkins, you paid Mr. Winkley a visit. You arrived just in time to rescue him from some Carnival goons. He told you that he had spoken to Ellie about some bracelets called the Bands of Shu. He also gave you a mental monocle that would allow you to pluck Ellie's current whereabouts from the minds of the carnies. <br><br>You took to the streets and returned with knowledge of Ellie's location. <br><br>She was being held in an old warehouse. You ventured there, and managed to free her from the Carnival. She told you about her investigation into the Bands' power. She seemed to believe they could help you fight the Carnival. <br><br>To recover the Bands, you had to go up against the Malta Group, who were keeping the bracelets locked away in one of their bases. <br><br>Then you had to empower them. You brought the Bands into contact with some Devouring Earth creatures to anchor them in this reality. Then you faced the Praetorians while wearing them, in order to give the Bands a taste of that which lies beyond this world. Lastly, you brought them to Penelope Yin to complete the ritual. <br><br>With the Bands empowered, you were ready to set foot on the psychic plane for the first time. You journeyed there and uncovered three of Vanessa's memories: some travel guides to Italy, a porcelain mask, and a pile of bones belonging to a woman named Giovanna Scaldi. <br><br>Giovanna Scaldi had to be important, but you didn't know how. You went back to the psychic plane, but this time you were unable to learn anything. Vanessa had found a way to protect her memories. <br><br>Harvey suggested you turn to Penelope Yin for help. You brought the mental monocle to her, and she was able to greatly amplify its power. <br><br>The next time you went to the psychic plane, you were able to use the monocle to summon forth a memory of Vanessa in her younger days. She told you about her first trip to Venice, where she found a lovely porcelain mask. <br><br>It was enough to pique your curiosity, and you went back to learn more. The next time you encountered a memory of Vanessa, she told you about the first and only time she put on the mask. When she put it on, the mind of Giovanna Scaldi flooded into hers. It seemed that Giovanna was an old Venetian criminal who had preserved her life by putting her soul into the mask. Terrified, Vanessa packed away the mask and vowed never to wear it again. <br><br>You and Harvey agreed: you had to know more. You went back to the psychic plane, where you encountered one last reflection of Vanessa. She told you that She had put on the mask in order to use its powers to battle the Rikti. She succeeded, but she was never again separate from Giovanna. <br><br>Harvey had a bold idea. If you could defeat Giovanna upon the psychic plane, Vanessa might be freed. You went again to Penelope Yin, who modified the monocle once more. Now you could use it to draw forth the soul of Giovanna. You did so, and defeated the mighty villain on the psychic plane. <br><br>You were hopeful that Vanessa and her minions had now been freed from Giovanna's psychic grip. You went to one of their hideouts, but learned that your hopes had been in vain. The Carnival was still going strong, with Vanessa holding the reigns. Apparently she had learned much from her time with Giovanna. <br><br>You had come to sympathize with Vanessa, but you knew she had to be stopped. You used the mental monocle to uncover her whereabouts, then went to her hideout and defeated her. Vanessa DeVore is currently serving time in the Ziggursky Prison, under the watch of several talented telepaths. It is unknown whether her mental powers are strong enough to subvert their control."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P679939247" "{HeroName}, I need your help desperately! One of my reporters has been kidnapped! Her name's Ellie Weissman, and she's a real sweet girl. Young, smart, talented. I've known her since she was a kid. Her apartment was ransacked by the Carnival this morning, and there's no sign of her anywhere! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you help me find Ellie?</A> If anything happens to her, I'll never be able to look her father in the eye again."
// AcceptString :
"P3263511087" "Find Ellie Weissman"
// SendOffString :
"P2143230061" "Ellie was working on a feature about mystical artifacts. I don't know if that's what set the Carnival off, but you should head over to the Tattler and take a look at her notes."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2807627967" "Defeat all carnies in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1091160231" "I'm really hoping Ellie's notes can tell us why the Carnival went after her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3625921726" "A picture of a startlingly young Harvey Maylor beams at you from the wall."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P715951356" "Let's teach these tattle tales a lesson!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3964872510" "Are you my new playmate?"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P149738578" "How adorable! You're trying to save the day!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P723141525" "Everything gets trashed!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2479234554" "This rag is no good anyway!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1151023998" "What's black and blue and dead all over? {HeroName}, in about five minutes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Desk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1569226463" "Ellie's desk"
// Description :
"P2123300177" "Find Ellie's notes"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2108058194" "You begin to search the desk."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2557807414" "You have been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1449234697" "You have finished searching the desk."
// InteractActionString :
"P1469950025" "Searching..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1924043600" "You found a worn appointment calendar."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P207338995" "You defeated the Carnival and found Ellie Weissman's notebook."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2327061402" "I just broke the news about Ellie's disappearance to her parents; let me tell you, that was rough. I can't even get worked up about the Tattler office being trashed. I just want to find my reporter! Maybe that appointment calendar you found can help us pick up her trail."
// RandomFameString :
"P616427218" "Did you hear about the Paragon Tattler? The whole office was torn up by the Carnival!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P473249142" "According to this appointment calendar you found, Ellie met with a Percy Winkley right before she was kidnapped. Perhaps this Mr. Winkley can tell us more about the situation. Trouble is, the only address we have is 'secret library.' I think I know someone who may be able to clear up that mystery. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you go ask Maria Jenkins about the secret library?</A> She's been around the block a few times; she knows more than most people might guess."
// AcceptString :
"P4288974689" "Ask Maria Jenkins about the secret library"
// SendOffString :
"P54065113" "I appreciate your help, {HeroName}. We're like a family at the Tattler; if we can't find Ellie, things will never be the same."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P119462724" "Ask Maria Jenkins about library"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1604952561" "Maria Jenkins might know where that secret library is."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P834958487" "Hey, Captain Chucklehead! Take this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P857572848" "Normally, I'd never divulge the secret of the Midnight Squad's underground library. But I've heard good things about you, {HeroName}. I'll tell you where it is, but I expect you to keep this information private."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1930601037" "Find Percy Winkley"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2695255010" "Percy Winkley was the last person Ellie met with before her disappearance. Maybe he can tell us what happened to her!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2776119427" "You've heard that the Midnight Squad has a network of secret libraries hidden beneath the city. Their resources are truly staggering."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P885662079" "Find Winkley and let's go!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2918262895" "But there are so many pretty baubles!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P52808935" "Hey there, {HeroName}. Want to play?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3667430854" "We're supposed to be looking for some sort of bracelets."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P824177656" "How about necklaces? Or brooches? Ooh, or tiaras?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1370693236" "This is our treasure hunt! Back off!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Percy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3272471599" "Percy Winkley"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3638335357" "I'll tell you everything I know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3014161173" "You rescued Percy Winkley from the Carnival of Shadows!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1131626186" "So, Ellie was asking about these Bands of Shu before she was kidnapped, eh? I wonder if they might be more powerful than the Midnight Squad realizes. I'll bet anything the Carnival kidnapped Ellie to keep her from learning more about the Bands. Now that you have that mental monocle, maybe we can get her back."
// RandomFameString :
"P1047648677" "I hear {HeroName} is in on all the Midnight Squad's secrets!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P412896990" "Thanks to Percy Winkley's mental monocle, we should be able to get some straight answers out of the Carnival. The monocle will allow you to read whatever thoughts are uppermost in the carnies' minds. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So just keep questioning them about my missing reporter, and don't stop until you find an answer!</A> You can usually find carnies making mischief on Peregrine Island."
// AcceptString :
"P349460127" "Question the carnies about the missing reporter"
// SendOffString :
"P2880456797" "As soon as we get Ellie back safely, we can find out more about her investigation into the Bands of Shu. I'm certain that's what prompted the Carnival to go after her!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1328200713" "Question carnies about Ellie"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P812095894" "Ellie's a dear friend, {HeroName}. Don't let me down on this one."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4024593908" "Look who's a big, tough hero!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2420585603" "You were able to pluck Ellie's current location from the mind of one of the carnies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2527238640" "Thank heaven, {HeroName}, you did it! You found out where the Carnival's keeping Ellie! Now you just have to go in there and get her out!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2068924318" "I saw {HeroName} go to town on some carnies earlier. Let me tell you, they weren't laughing!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2579196489" "We've got all the information we need, {HeroName}. It's time to stop pussyfooting around. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over to that Carnival hideout and rescue Ellie.</A> I'll be counting the minutes until you're back."
// AcceptString :
"P1817157961" "Rescue Ellie"
// SendOffString :
"P2523390044" "Ellie got into trouble by investigating a story for my paper. That makes me responsible for her safety."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P919255886" "Rescue Ellie Weissman"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4225020502" "You're Ellie's only hope, {HeroName}. Find her!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1850824632" "Your trained nose detects a subtle aroma of Chanel No. 5."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P867217356" "Weissman better start talking. Heroes could be coming."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P607796767" "Yeah, thanks, Captian Obvious."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P1032045937" "Hey! That's not Captain Obvious! It's {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P298594771" "Eat this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P906972397" "Twinkle Toes"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P140926746" "Ms. Weissman will cooperate soon."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4214976837" "You have no idea who you're dealing with!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Ellie 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1636377869" "Ellie Weissman"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1227587665" "Oh, {Rescuer}! You've got to know what's going on!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2723542628" "You rescued Ellie Weissman from the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P66151393" "I don't know how to thank you enough for rescuing my reporter. Ellie's safe at home now, and I don't think I've ever been more grateful. She's got a lot to tell us about her investigation into the Bands of Shu. She seems to think they may be instrumental in taking on the Carnival."
// RandomFameString :
"P2041677703" "You know Ellie Weissman's from the Tattler? I heard she was rescued by {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3385782927" "{HeroName}, you have my eternal gratitude for rescuing Ellie from the Carnival of Shadows. She's told me a lot about her investigation into the Bands of Shu, and, from what she says, there's a good chance the Bands could help us defeat the Carnival of Shadows. There's only one problem. The Bands are currently held by the Malta Group; they're among the many artifacts the group has locked up for study. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go and get them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2039225667" "Get the Bands of Shu from the Malta Group"
// SendOffString :
"P4013229749" "The Malta Group wants to control anyone and anything with even the merest whiff of super powers. Don't underestimate them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P232789067" "Recover the Bands of Shu"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3509151825" "The Bands of Shu are important, {HeroName}. They could really help us fight the Carnival."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3366432686" "The Malta Group's alarm system is subtle, but you notice the click as the security camera zooms in on your face."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2887084131" "Prepare for maximum force."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1595183653" "Check. One dead hero, coming up."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3159648487" "Open fire!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3805740019" "This breach of security is unacceptable."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1188502394" "Don't worry. It won't last long."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P817803973" "You've seen far too much to live!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ShuBands 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2252294519" "Safe"
// InteractBeginString :
"P844517521" "You begin cracking the safe."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2463775259" "You have cracked the safe."
// InteractActionString :
"P2709237130" "Cracking safe..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2147767048" "You found the Bands of Shu!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2822479411" "My, those Bands certainly are unique. Kind of pretty, too. Ellie's been looking into them, and she thinks they may help us take the fight to Vanessa DeVore where she really lives: on the psychic plane!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1068733353" "I saw {HeroName} running around with some crazy bracelets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2165480746" "I'm impressed, {HeroName}. You managed to get the Bands of Shu away from those Malta goons. The trouble is, right now, they're useless. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>In order to take you to the psychic plane, the Bands have to be empowered.</A> Ellie's researched the ritual involved, but it's going to be a toughie. <br><br>First, you'll need to bring the bands into contact with a powerful, but primitive creature. That should anchor you in this reality, so you don't lose yourself on the psychic plane. Then, you'll need to bring them into contact with an extra-dimensional entity. That'll give them the power they need to transport you to another plane of existence. And, finally, you'll have to bring them to Penelope Yin to complete the ritual."
// AcceptString :
"P2716323804" "Empower the Bands of Shu"
// SendOffString :
"P4273826925" "Good luck, {HeroName}. This is a big task, but I think you're up to it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6.1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2381373612" "Defeat all creatures in cave"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3890203712" "You need to bring the bands into contact with as many Devouring Earth creatures as you can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2845517418" "The earthy smell of the Devouring Earth creatures is heavy in this cave."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3563683529" "Hurraahhhh!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P2948748678" "Grrrrarr!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1847097414" "You have completed the first part of the ritual."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6.1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2912318583" "Defeat all villains in area"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2410867508" "The Bands have been anchored in our reality. Now you have to give them a taste of what's outside it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2511296215" "The Praetorians are an inexplicable lot to you. Their embrace of tyranny is truly staggering."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3596222263" "You have completed the second portion of the ritual."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6.1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1077028969" "Take Bands to Penelope Yin"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1466183326" "Now all you need is a powerful mind to wrap up the ritual. You know who's got the beefiest brain in town, don'tcha?"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3584531968" "{HeroName} mustn't empower the Bands of Shu!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P996339760" "Ah, sure! It's REAL easy to complete this ritual. It's sort of like flipping a mental switch. Yep! There you are. <br><br>The Bands of Shu are now empowered with the essence of the Egyptian goddess, Shu. She's the one who who kept the sky and the Earth separate. What most folks don' know is that she also held the task of keeping different planes of existence from folding into one another. By wearing her Bands, you can manipulate those planes and walk among them as you will. You're seeing a college education at work here, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2738539888" "I knew you had it in you, {HeroName}. You've empowered the Bands of Shu. Now you can use them to take you to the psychic plane and battle the Carnival there. Are you ready for that?"
// RandomFameString :
"P288452357" "{HeroName}'s been battling all sorts of villains lately. Now, that's what I call {HeroAdjective}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2525236587" "Penelope Yin explained this to me; let's see if I've got it straight. Vanessa DeVore has been psychically dominating so many people for years, that her mind is spread out all across the psychic plane. In a way, you're going to be literally roaming around in her brain, battling her mental defenses. You're going to be a pioneer, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Vanessa may be able to erect barriers to wall off some of her thoughts, but I need you to learn whatever you can about and the Carnival of Shadows.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3719077601" "Go to the psychic plane and learn whatever you can about the Carnival of Shadows"
// SendOffString :
"P1342257774" "Penelope Yin has set up what she calls a 'mental gateway' in a nearby office building. She says it's all about perception; all I know is, it'll get you where you're going."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2753949655" "Seek clues on psychic plane"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2412943951" "Have you learned anything that might help us against the Carnival?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P592135306" "You can't help doubting the effectiveness of Penelope Yin's mental gateway, but it seems to work like a charm."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P227482245" "How did anyone find us here?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3307673713" "Hide your memories!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P347133570" "You will never leave our realm!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3717946334" "Memory"
// Description :
"P2858149992" "memories to uncover"
// SingularDescription :
"P1947820482" "Uncover the last memory!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P514219474" "You begin to plumb the memory."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1335862685" "You have plumbed Vanessa's memory of these bones."
// InteractActionString :
"P645036512" "Plumbing memory..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P742583127" "These bones belong to a woman named Giovanna Scaldi."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bookcase 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2451634974" "You have plumbed Vanessa's memory of these books."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4189696593" "These books belonged to a young Vanessa DeVore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Display 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P327216820" "You have plumbed Vanessa's memory of this chest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3637798777" "This exquisite porcelain mask is hundreds of years old."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4100947561" "You have recovered some interesting memories from Vanessa DeVore's mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2255789366" "Wow, it sounds like you learned a lot while you were adventuring on the psychic plane. I can't begin to understand the significance of all of the memories you uncovered. The one that really puzzles me is this Giovanna Scaldi. Who was she? Why are her bones rattling around inside Vanessa's head? I think she must be important to the Carnival, but it's impossible to say how. {HeroName}, I think you're going to have to go back."
// RandomFameString :
"P689879521" "I heard {HeroName} saying something about journeying to a psychic plane! Let me tell you, nothing stands in that hero's way!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P32056113" "Your first journey on the psychic plane was fruitful, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So fruitful that I'm sending you back.</A> We need to know more about this Giovanna Scaldi you found traces of in Vanessa DeVore's memory. I couldn't find any mention of her in public records. I think there's only one way to find out who she really was."
// AcceptString :
"P3435598039" "Go back to the psychic plane"
// SendOffString :
"P2647775042" "Penelope Yin set up another mental gateway for you. This one's in an old cave."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1527161453" "Defeat all minions on plane"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2590797179" "Have you learned anything more about this Giovanna Scaldi?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2445592690" "As you enter the psychic plane, you feel a tingle on the back of your neck. Or rather, the psychic projection of the back of your neck."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1362276068" "{HeroName} has no idea what's in store!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1364931661" "The fool thought this trick would work again?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4170257746" "We're ready for you this time!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3942010920" "{HeroName} won't try this again!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P147097606" "You can count on that!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3475642916" "Come into my parlor!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P128850224" "Mistress of Memory"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P311747860" "All of our secrets are locked up tight."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1171941761" "You won't succeed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4034759415" "You weren't able to learn anything from Vanessa's mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2990146948" "You weren't able to learn anything on the psychic plane? It sounds like Vanessa DeVore found a way to shield her memories from you. We'll have to see what can be done about that."
// RandomFameString :
"P2149720565" "I haven't seen {HeroName} in too many battles lately. I wonder what's going on?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand9.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P964254657" "You remember that mental monocle Percy Winkley gave you, the one that helped you find my missing reporter, Ellie? Well, I hung onto it. I thought it might come in handy some day. Anyway, I just spoke with Penelope Yin, and she thinks she can modify it for you. We know Vanessa DeVore's found some way to shield her memories from you. Perhaps with Penelope Yin's help, we can change that. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you take the monocle to her?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P309889486" "Take the mental monocle to Penelope Yin"
// SendOffString :
"P241270334" "Penelope Yin may be the most talented woman I know."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1797662133" "Take monocle to Penelope Yin"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2274693807" "Penelope Yin can modify that mental monocle for us. Then we may be able to learn more about Vanessa DeVore's memories."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2266764859" "Give it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1073813314" "Here's the monocle. Let's see what Penelope Yin can do with it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4276107272" "Is this the monocle? Ah, how cool! It uses a lens of elestial quartz to let you see into the minds of those nearby. It's kinda weak, but I think I can boost the power.  <br><br>There! Now the monocle should allow you to read minds much more easily than before. When you think of a particular subject, you can cause those nearby to think of that subject as well. This should let you plumb Vanessa DeVore's mind for more on this strange Giovanna Scaldi. Just, uh, don't go turning into a villain now, OK? Because it's going to make me look REALLY bad."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P390073655" "Great! Now that Penelope Yin's worked her special talents on that mental monocle, you can go back to the psychic plane. We should be able to learn a lot more about Giovanna Scaldi's connection to Vanessa DeVore."
// RandomFameString :
"P4035297769" "Did you see that doohickey {HeroName} took to Penelope Yin?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2122932653" "All right, {HeroName}. Penelope Yin's done her thing, and that mental monocle is good to go. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Once you get to the psychic plane, it should let you read Vanessa's thoughts.</A> We need to find out more about this strange Giovanna Scaldi you found traces of within her memory. I really think she may be important."
// AcceptString :
"P615851547" "Go to the psychic plane and read Vanessa's thoughts"
// SendOffString :
"P1697685045" "All this psychic plane stuff is a bit confusing for a simple man like me. I sure hope you're taking pictures."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2450242549" "Investigate Vanessa's memories"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2774300906" "We need to know more about what's going on in Vanessa's mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1643225779" "You're becoming used to the tingling sensation that means you've entered Vanessa's psychic domain."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Memory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3400963073" "Vanessa DeVore, 1998"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P166956779" "I want to tell you my story!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3826992973" "You uncovered Vanessa's memories of her younger days."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2929492370" "I had no idea Penelope Yin could make that mental monocle so powerful! You not only read Vanessa's mind, you actually summoned up an image of her younger self! {HeroName}! We have to know more!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2347264421" "{HeroName}'s been wearing this weird crystal monocle. What's that about?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1956712134" "We've learned a lot from your forays in the psychic plane, {HeroName}. We've learned that, as recently as 1998, Vanessa was nothing more than a simple art student with barely enough cash to fund a trip to Venice. We've learned that the mask she wears is responsible for her rise to power, and we've also learned that this is somehow connected to the death of a woman named Giovanna Scaldi. It's a lot of information, {HeroName}, but it still lacks cohesion. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to learn more.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2131820109" "Go back to the psychic plane to learn more about Vanessa's past"
// SendOffString :
"P326065416" "While you're gone, I'm going to do some digging. I've had no luck finding a local record of Giovanna Scaldi, but perhaps the Venetian authorities can be of help."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3330876488" "You've learned a lot about the Carnival's origins. We just need to tie up the loose ends."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1915251081" "You were strangely affected by the vision of Vanessa's younger self you encountered on your last foray to the psychic plane. In a way, you're hoping you see her again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Memory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P924192988" "Vanessa DeVore, 2000"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3265825949" "Would you like to know more about me?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2323463824" "You uncovered Vanessa's memories of the mask that changed her forever."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3784823780" "While you were gone, I got on the horn to a records keeper over in Venice. It's true, Giovanna Scaldi was Venetian. She died mysteriously in 1698, while awaiting execution for various crimes. According to what you've recovered from Vanessa's memories, it sounds like she didn't die after all. Somehow, she put her soul into that porcelain mask. And when Vanessa put it on, three hundred years later, Giovanna nearly killed her. <br><br>There's still one thing I don't understand. According to Vanessa's memory, she put the mask away and planned never to use it again. So what happened to change her mind?"
// RandomFameString :
"P3216953181" "I hear {HeroName} is learning a lot about the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2556947134" "According to the memories you've uncovered, Vanessa DeVore never planned to be evil. In fact, she sounds like a pleasant, innocent girl. What can I tell you, {HeroName}, I'm a journalist. I have to see this story through to the end. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you go into the psychic plane once more?</A> There's more to learn here, we just have to figure out what!"
// AcceptString :
"P1879578347" "Go into the psychic plane once more"
// SendOffString :
"P2666309372" "Just so we're clear. You are taking pictures. Right?"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2765896157" "I want to know why Vanessa went bad."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P258180700" "You've become sympathetic toward the young, hopeful Vanessa DeVore. Just like {ContactName}, you have to know why she turned to evil."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Memory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P86012510" "Vanessa DeVore, 2002"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P903928907" "I have no regrets!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3714034292" "You uncovered Vanessa's memories of her partnership with Giovanna Scaldi."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2420491050" "So, Vanessa DeVore put the mask on because she believed that it would help her defeat the Rikti. And it did, but at a price. She's unable to separate herself from the soul of Giovanna Scaldi who dwells within the mask. If this doesn't rate a cover story, I don't know what does."
// RandomFameString :
"P3405375515" "{HeroName}'s saying that the Carnival is actually led by someone named Giovanna Scaldi!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound13.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3386519865" "Bear with me, {HeroName}. I've got a theory. We know that Vanessa DeVore was just a humble art student, until she got mixed up with the mask containing the soul of Giovanna Scaldi. Well, what if we could defeat Giovanna herself, upon the psychic plane? Would Vanessa return to the way she used to be? It's a long shot, but I think it's worth trying. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to take that mental monocle back to Penelope Yin.</A> Maybe she can figure out a way to make Giovanna appear."
// AcceptString :
"P664504034" "Take the mental monocle back to Penelope Yin"
// SendOffString :
"P254424900" "Maybe I'm crazy to think that there's hope for Vanessa yet. But it's the kind of crazy I want to be."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound13.1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P979652365" "Penelope Yin needs to see that mental monocle."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P84303837" "Boy, are you in for it now!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P521855745" "Sure, I can mess around with the monocle. But are you sure you want to face Giovanna Scaldi on the psychic plane? I mean, she is going to be REALLY tough. Those immortals always are. <br><br>If you're sure, I'll do as you ask. The monocle will now allow you to summon forth the soul of Giovanna Scaldi. Good luck fighting the immortal witch on the psychic plane!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound13.1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2639649452" "Defeat Giovanna & her defenses"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3182059275" "If you can defeat Giovanna on the psychic plane, it may free Vanessa from her grip."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2543841621" "You feel a hot puff of air on your face; you could almost swear it was the breath of an angry, malevolent goddess."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2543511625" "{HeroName} has grown far stronger."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P543086099" "We must protect our lady!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3530252075" "You will never touch Giovanna!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3213402944" "Giovanna Scaldi"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3144174320" "{HeroName} will regret this deeply."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P664685860" "You think you can defeat me within my own mind? Here, I am a goddess!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Giovanna 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P156440732" "You defeated Giovanna Scaldi!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P589160419" "You did it, {HeroName}! You did it! You defeated the soul of Giovanna Scaldi! I can hardly believe it, but it's true. With Giovanna gone, I truly believe the Carnival will dissolve. There'll be nothing to make Vanessa be evil anymore, and she can go back to her own life! It's like a dream come true!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2566361148" "The Tattler is running a story about {HeroName}'s big showdown on the psychic plane. Not sure I believe it, but it makes a good read."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission14 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P676606956" "You've defeated Giovanna Scaldi, and with her, the evil seed that prompted the Carnival's creation. If my guess is correct, the Carnival is no more. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I just need you to go to one of their warehouses and confirm that fact for me.</A> Then we can start helping the displaced carnies put their lives back together. After years of being mentally dominated by Giovanna, they probably won't know where to start."
// AcceptString :
"P4149758148" "Go to a carnie hideout and confirm that the Carnival is no more"
// SendOffString :
"P2986615614" "I'm going to speak to the City Council about a medal for you, {HeroName}. Really. You deserve it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4041235545" "Stop all villains in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P853311653" "I want to know exactly what's going on at that Carnival hideout."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1161837308" "The moment you step through the door, you hear a high-pitched, hyena-like laugh. And you know that {ContactName} was wrong."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2901752693" "With Giovanna gone, what will we do?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2149492167" "Fool! Vanessa has learned plenty by now."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2174112432" "You will die for your trespass!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P501963135" "Can Vanessa continue to lead us?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2107460700" "Of course. Giovanna hasn't been in charge for a long time."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1589310881" "You have meddled too much."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P216243892" "You defeated the Carnival."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3352480015" "I guess I was wrong, {HeroName}. Even with Giovanna defeated, the Carnival is still going strong. It makes me sad, to tell you the truth. After hearing your stories about the young Vanessa DeVore, I really hoped we could save her. But I guess we've got one more villain to go after."
// RandomFameString :
"P2000176895" "{HeroName} looks mad. I wonder if a mission went wrong?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound15 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3748859790" "Vanessa's still out there somewhere, and we've got to take her down. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to take the mental monocle back to the streets, {HeroName}.</A> We need to learn Vanessa's location."
// AcceptString :
"P4101629998" "Take the mental monocle back to the streets"
// SendOffString :
"P1994324921" "I really hoped we could save Vanessa DeVore. I guess you'll have to defeat her instead."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound15_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3862511952" "Learn Vanessa's whereabouts"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2468366866" "We still don't know where to find Vanessa DeVore."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P756614918" "Nanny nanny boo-boo! You can't catch me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4030341353" "From the mind of one of the carnies you defeated, you have plucked Vanessa DeVore's current whereabouts."
// RandomFameString :
"P2812689219" "{HeroName}'s no friend to the Carnival!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound15_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3364766857" "Defeat Vanessa & her servants"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1198248477" "You've got to go out there and defeat Vanessa DeVore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2538390806" "After romping around in Vanessa DeVore's mind, you feel as though you know her. In some ways, you regret that you have to be the one to take her down."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3948219263" "Vanessa DeVore"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2848483038" "It seems Giovanna's powers are no longer necessary. I am truly the Carnival's queen now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4088819863" "<em clap f=a>You may have defeated Giovanna. <em laugh f=a>But you shall never defeat me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3851042739" "No! I am forever!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P547484158" "You defeated Vanessa DeVore!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1774014201" "Good work, {HeroName}. I really thought that Vanessa could be saved. Based on what you gleaned from her memories, it seems that she really was a good person, once upon a time. She even gave up control of her mind to help fight the Rikti Invasion! <br><br>But I guess enough power can twist any heart, even one steeped in good intentions. With Vanessa in prison, perhaps we can put a stop to the Carnival for good."
// RandomFameString :
"P1345106263" "{HeroName} defeated Vanessa DeVore!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
